Setup			3D_01rH_gas_vcap_accret

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.05            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0 		Surface Density at r=1
SigmaSlope		1.0		Slope of the surface density
FlaringIndex		0.25		Flare of the disk
ALPHA               1.0e-2
Beta                1.0
Gamma               1.4

### Dust parameters

Invstokes1		10.0   Inverse of the Stokes number for dust1
Epsilon                 1.0e-20    Dust-to-gas mass ratio
DUST_HRATIO             1.0     Dust scale-height ratio H_d/H_g (Athena Hratio_1)
DUSTFLOOR       1.0e-6

### Floor parameters (Athena++-style)
GASFLOOR         1.0e-7     Absolute gas density floor
ENERGYFLOOR      1.0e-10    Energy floor for adiabatic EOS
DUST_PERCENT_FLOOR  0.0    Dust percent floor (0 = disabled)
DUST_TVCAP_FLAG     1      Enable terminal-velocity cap (0=off, 1=on)
DUST_TVCAP_FACTOR   2.0    TV-cap multiplier (Athena default 2.0)
DUST_TVCAP_D2G_MAX  1.0e-3  Max dust-to-gas ratio for TV-cap trigger
DUST_TVCAP_RHO_FLOOR_FACTOR  2.0e4  Rho floor factor for D2G gating (Athena default 2e4)
DUST_TVCAP_LOW_GAS_FLOOR_FACTOR  5.0e3  Low gas floor factor (Athena default 5e3)
DUST_TVCAP_VRATIO_OVERRIDE  8.0  Force cap when |v_d|/|v_g| exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_MACH_OVERRIDE     8.0  Force cap when |v_d|/cs exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_Z_HG_RATIO        2.5  Altitude threshold (in scale heights) for override
DUST_TVCAP_TOP_N_PHYS_LEVELS 5    Stretched-mesh proxy for Athena top-N physical levels; 5 means full current domain
### Near-planet free-fall cap (Athena++ style)
DUST_VCAP_FLAG      1      Enable near-planet velocity cap (0=off, 1=on)
DUST_VCAP_FACTOR    2.0    Free-fall cap factor
DUST_VCAP_RADIUS_RATIO 0.1  Planet Hill radius fraction for cap region
# Anomaly check (Athena style)
ANOMALY_CHECK_FLAG            0    Enable 26-neighbor anomaly check (0=off, 1=on)
ANOMALY_CHECK_R_RATIO         0.5  Radius ratio for anomaly check region
ANOMALY_CHECK_HILL_RATIO      2.0  Hill radius ratio for anomaly check
# Relative median cap (Athena style)
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_FLAG      1    Enable 6-neighbor median cap (Athena relmedian default is on)
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_FACTOR   8.0  Median cap factor (Athena dust_tvcap_relmedian_override default)
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_MAX_ITERS 8   Max iterative relmedian sweeps (Athena default)
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_RHO_FLOOR_FACTOR 0.1 Optional rho_d raise for median-capped cells (Athena default)

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/modelB_J3e-4.cfg
RocheSmoothing          0.10
Eccentricity            0.0
IndirectTerm            yes

### Planetary Accretion (Athena++ Mode 2) - for gas stage
PLANETARY_ACCRETION_FLAG   1    Enable planetary accretion (0=off, 1=on)
ACCRETION_RADIUS_RATIO    1.0  Accretion radius in units of Roche smoothing length
ACCRETION_TAU_FACTOR     1.0  Timescale factor for Mode 2 accretion

### Mesh parameters
Nx                      1024
Ny                      320
Nz                      256

Xmin                    -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax                     3.14159265358979323844

Ymin                    0.3
Ymax                    2.3

# test-only vertical box: pi/2 +/- 0.15
Zmin                    1.420796326794897
Zmax                    1.720796326794897

Spacing                 N

# tighter azimuthal refinement around phi=0
XMA                     0.06
XMB                     0.12
XMC                     6.0

# tighter radial refinement around r=1
YMY0                    1.0
YMA                     0.06
YMB                     0.14
YMC                     12.0

Disk            YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			G

### Damping
DampingZone     1.2
TauDamp         0.1
KillingBCColatitude  0.3    # Meridional damping strength (0=disabled)

### Output control parameters
CFL         0.3
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length
Ninterm	 		100		Time steps between outputs
Ntot			2000		Total number of time steps

FuncArchFile    setups/3D_01rH_gas_vcap_accret/func_arch.cfg
OutputDir		@outputs/3D_01rH_vcap_accret
